      "source": "Each instance of this class represents one link in the chain. The public\nconstructor <a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.web.server.WebHandler,java.util.List)\"><code>DefaultWebFilterChain(WebHandler, List)</code></a>\ninitializes the full chain and represents its first link.",
      "translation": "该类中的每个实例代表链中的一个链接。公共构造函数 <a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.web.server.WebHandler,java.util.List)\"><code>DefaultWebFilterChain(WebHandler, List)</code></a> 初始化整个链，并代表其第一个链接。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
